// Weapon loadouts (roadmap R3): three per class, the default first.
//
// Each loadout's `icon` (an Interface\Icons name of the 1.12 client) stands for it on the warband
// screen's Weapon loadout row; its tooltip tells the rest.
//
// Each weapon: its `hand` (MainHand, OffHand, Ranged), `kind` (it sets how the client holds and
// sheathes it), a `name` the cards show, its `swing` for a class that swings (`seconds` between
// swings and `share` of the class's `auto_attack` damage: two-handers 3.6 s, one-handers 1.8 s,
// dual wield a slow main hand and a fast off hand at 50 %), and its `looks`: a look in
// every zone's armaments (the zone's id, its `row` as gear.ron's looks for
// Blackrock's and Stratholme's second, the item's name, its ItemDisplayInfo.dbc display, and its
// own `kind` where the item is another kind than the weapon's). One weapon drop of a zone ("<zone>
// Armaments") unlocks its looks for all three loadouts.
// Naxxramas's wait for its zone. Stratholme's armaments mix Stratholme
// and Scholomance drops, row 0 mostly Stratholme's, row 1 ("Scholomance sets") mostly
// Scholomance's.
//
// `effects` use the talents' vocabulary at rank 1: Stat(stat, per_rank), AbilityMod(filter,
// kind, per_rank) for every spell's numbers, Milestone(...) for procs on the weapon swing.
// "-10 % cooldowns" is AbilityMod(filter: Any, kind: Cooldown, per_rank: 0.1) (every cooldown
// x 0.9); "cooldown recovery" is the CooldownRecovery stat.
